      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey all,\n\nThe leaderboard is intentionally limited to grabbing ~100 friends, which was a bit of an unfortunate optimization left in from the previous Pride Month campaign when it was causing some performance issues. \n\nThings are going quite well performance-wise with this campaign so far, however I would like to wait until after this weekend to start increasing the amount of friends included in the leaderboard so that we don't unintentionally cause an outage during the weekend!\n\nI'll also be jotting down some ideas for designing a better leaderboard system to accommodate much larger friend lists in future iterations of leaderboard-like systems aimed at friends, if we implement that for something.\n\nTLDR: We'll start increasing on Monday after gathering performance metrics over the weekend during high-traffic times.",
